mkstub s-moved    "- **URL (as stated by the immediate source):** http://127.0.0.1:$SP/moved"
mkstub s-nohead   "- **Artifact location:** http://127.0.0.1:$SP/nohead — fetched with curl"
mkstub s-gone     "- **URL:** http://127.0.0.1:$SP/gone"
mkstub s-removed  "- **URL:** http://127.0.0.1:$SP/removed"
mkstub s-boom     "- **URL:** http://127.0.0.1:$SP/boom"
